			],
			"Message": "NC: Apply naming convention standardization\n\n- Rename Grove Transport modules to PascalCase (NC-05):\n  - gRPCTransport.rs -> GrpcTransport.rs\n  - IPCTransport.rs -> IpcTransport.rs\n- Update mod.rs references to use new module names\n\nNaming Convention verification completed:\n- NC-24 to NC-28: Namespace patterns (verified, none needed)\n- NC-31 to NC-33: File naming conventions (verified correct)\n- NC-34: No lowercase .ts files found\n- NC-35 to NC-37: Directory naming (verified correct)\n- NC-38 to NC-40: Rust types PascalCase (verified correct)\n- NC-41 to NC-48: Advanced naming patterns (verified correct)\n\nNote: Some lowercase module names in Mist and Mountain are\ngenerated protobuf code and should remain unchanged.",
			"SHA": "e93aa699683e480201f307d6124df216689c503f"
		},
