			"Message": "fix(deps): Standardize Grove to use workspace dependencies\n\n- Convert most hardcoded versions to workspace references\n- Updated workspace dependencies: tokio, anyhow, thiserror, tracing,\n  tracing-subscriber, clap, bytes, futures, async-trait, chrono,\n  uuid, base64, metrics, opentelemetry\n- Keep specialized dependencies as hardcoded: tokio-util, wasmtime,\n  wasmparser, prost, tonic, semver, shellexpand, reqwest,\n  metrics-exporter-prometheus, opentelemetry-otlp, etc.\n\nAddresses DEP-009: Grove workspace dependency standardization",
